[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-powergas-graduate-trainee-program-2026-eligibility-and-requirements-121":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},121,"powergas-graduate-trainee-program-2026-eligibility-and-requirements-121","Powergas Graduate Trainee Program 2026 | Eligibility And Requirements","\u003Cp>Powergas Nigeria Limited is inviting application for the 2026 Graduate Trainee Programme offering an employment opportunity.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Powergas Graduate Trainee Program Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: Powergas Nigeria Limited\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Finternships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Internships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ftrainings\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Sponsorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>12-month graduate trainee programme\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Structured training and development\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mentorship from industry professionals\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Exposure to oil &amp; gas operations\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hands-on practical experience\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Career growth opportunities\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: April 10, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Powergas Graduate Trainee Program Details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Powergas Nigeria is inviting applications for its 2026 Graduate Trainee Program. This is a 12-month structured programme designed to develop young graduates and equip them with practical experience in the oil and gas industry.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Powergas offers a high-growth environment focused on professional development and technical excellence in the evolving energy sector.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The company provides clean, reliable, and cost-effective energy solutions to industries, power generation companies, and residential estates not connected to gas pipelines.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Powergas Graduate Trainee Program 2026 Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Participants will gain in the Powergas Graduate Trainee Program 2026:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Oil &amp; Gas\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>12-month graduate trainee programme\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Structured training and development\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mentorship from industry professionals\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Exposure to oil &amp; gas operations\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hands-on practical experience\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Career growth opportunitiesPowergas Graduate Trainee Program 2026 Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Powergas Graduate Trainee Program 2026 Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the Powergas Graduate Trainee Program 2026, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Bachelor’s degree (minimum Second Class Upper – 2:1)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>NYSC completed (Discharge\u002FExemption Certificate)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Not more than 28 years old\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Must have graduated within the last 3 years\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligible to work in Nigeria full-time\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Powergas Graduate Trainee Program Required Documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the Powergas Graduate Trainee Program 2026, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Oil &amp; Gas\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>CV or Resumes\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"http:\u002F\u002Fpel.com.ng\u002Fcgi-sys\u002Fdefaultwebpage.cgi\">http:\u002F\u002Fpel.com.ng\u002Fcgi-sys\u002Fdefaultwebpage.cgi\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-08 12:40:37",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fpowergas-graduate-trainee-program-2026-eligibility-and-requirements\u002F69d63eb5c26946.35764845_screenshot 2026-04-08 122831.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fpowergas-graduate-trainee-program-2026-eligibility-and-requirements\u002F69d63eb5c26946.35764845_screenshot%202026-04-08%20122831.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,47,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-